WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:02.970
- [Narrator] Follow this simple technique.

00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:04.720
Find a quiet place,

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:09.720
visualize your goal and
remember that you are amazing.

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:14.260
- You said you heard screaming?

00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:16.233
- Yes, angry, taunting.

00:00:17.435 --> 00:00:19.390
I just want a quiet house.

00:00:19.390 --> 00:00:20.747
(scream)

00:00:20.747 --> 00:00:21.680
- You hear that?

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:22.863
- Something's here.

00:00:22.863 --> 00:00:24.846
- What if I have a bad dream?

00:00:24.846 --> 00:00:26.240
(scream)

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:30.160
What if I dream that you send
us away into the dark and we

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:31.470
get hurt.

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:36.010
How I can't stand it
anymore and I have to die.

00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:37.673
And time on a silver table,

00:00:38.590 --> 00:00:40.892
with my jaw wired shut.

00:00:40.892 --> 00:00:43.423
- (sobs) Mommy?

00:00:43.423 --> 00:00:46.043
- Would you wake us up
from a dream like that?

00:00:46.043 --> 00:00:48.210
- Get out from under there.

00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:49.410
- I'm not under your bed,

00:00:49.410 --> 00:00:51.244
I'm inside of your head.

00:00:51.244 --> 00:00:52.111
(scream)

00:00:52.111 --> 00:00:53.497
- [Demonic Voice] I could punish you.

00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:57.813
- And I always keep my promises.

00:00:59.038 --> 00:01:02.288
(distant child laughs)

00:01:05.020 --> 00:01:07.520
(loud scream)

00:01:09.954 --> 00:01:12.037
(scream)

00:01:14.463 --> 00:01:15.823
- I hope there is no God.

00:01:17.252 --> 00:01:18.760
(bones crunching)

00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:20.260
Because if there is no heaven.

00:01:25.793 --> 00:01:26.626
(rats squeaking)

00:01:26.626 --> 00:01:28.043
There is no hell.

00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:30.871
- Most people don't know you,

00:01:30.871 --> 00:01:34.813
they don't see the evil
and the ugly in your heart.

00:01:39.406 --> 00:01:40.494
(siren wailing)

00:01:40.494 --> 00:01:41.894
- It's the end of the world.

00:01:48.760 --> 00:01:50.460
- Maybe it's time to eat somebody.

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:54.540
- The census taker once tried to test me,

00:01:54.540 --> 00:01:59.540
I ate his liver with some
flava beans and a nice Chianti.

00:02:01.407 --> 00:02:03.290
(sucking in breath)

00:02:03.290 --> 00:02:05.490
- It rubs the lotion on its skin

00:02:05.490 --> 00:02:07.353
or else it gets the hose again.

00:02:08.737 --> 00:02:10.860
- They're probably watching me,

00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:12.147
well let them,

00:02:12.147 --> 00:02:14.883
let them see what kind of a person I am.

00:02:16.180 --> 00:02:18.778
I hope they are watching
(scream and slashing)

00:02:18.778 --> 00:02:19.611
they'll see,

00:02:19.611 --> 00:02:23.287
they'll see and they'll
know and they'll say,

00:02:23.287 --> 00:02:26.371
"well she wouldn't even harm a fly."

00:02:26.371 --> 00:02:28.454
(scream)

00:02:29.653 --> 00:02:32.373
- I think my mask of
sanity is about to slim.

00:02:33.517 --> 00:02:34.740
- [Female] Here we go now.

00:02:34.740 --> 00:02:36.040
- We're not through yet.

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:38.028
Did you know I'm utterly insane?

00:02:38.028 --> 00:02:40.004
(chainsaw revving)

00:02:40.004 --> 00:02:42.002
- Paul? (screaming)

00:02:42.002 --> 00:02:44.169
(banging)

00:02:47.380 --> 00:02:49.661
- I have to kill a lot of people.

00:02:49.661 --> 00:02:50.494
(smashing glass)

00:02:50.494 --> 00:02:52.577
(scream)

00:02:54.830 --> 00:02:56.876
- They always seat it like that in,

00:02:56.876 --> 00:02:58.100
ah, chapter wise.

00:02:58.100 --> 00:02:59.340
- But not you,

00:02:59.340 --> 00:03:00.772
not with my misery.

00:03:00.772 --> 00:03:02.667
(bone crunches and scream)

00:03:02.667 --> 00:03:05.260
Misery was buried in the
ground at the end Paul,

00:03:05.260 --> 00:03:07.127
so you'll have to start there.

00:03:07.127 --> 00:03:11.512
No, not my misery.

00:03:11.512 --> 00:03:15.443
God, I love you.

00:03:15.443 --> 00:03:18.193
- I bet you think your husband
will be back any minute.

00:03:19.263 --> 00:03:20.096
- Not like this,

00:03:20.096 --> 00:03:21.533
I'm serious, stop.

00:03:21.533 --> 00:03:22.366
Gerald?

00:03:26.929 --> 00:03:28.179
Somebody, help.

00:03:34.183 --> 00:03:35.187
- Try to call for help,

00:03:35.187 --> 00:03:37.270
there's no one for miles.

00:03:45.971 --> 00:03:48.388
(screams no)

00:03:50.669 --> 00:03:53.106
- What were you doing last night?

00:03:53.106 --> 00:03:54.600
- What real evidence have we got?

00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:55.433
Nothing.

00:03:56.510 --> 00:03:58.483
(man yells)

00:03:58.483 --> 00:04:01.316
(shotgun loading)

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:06.629
- Everything I did here,

00:04:06.629 --> 00:04:07.860
I did to protect us.

00:04:07.860 --> 00:04:09.490
- Nearly enough.

00:04:09.490 --> 00:04:11.657
(screams)

00:04:17.115 --> 00:04:18.115
- Wait here.

00:04:20.301 --> 00:04:23.634
- I don't think no one's on the horizon.

00:04:26.270 --> 00:04:27.103
- These people,

00:04:27.103 --> 00:04:28.253
they're blasphemous.

00:04:29.775 --> 00:04:31.723
A cult, a disease.

00:04:32.950 --> 00:04:33.990
- This island,

00:04:33.990 --> 00:04:36.240
it's our paradise.

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:40.280
- You shall be cleansed according
to the Edith of this land.

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:41.830
(screams)

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:42.783
Let us begin.

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:47.303
(lightning)

00:04:48.817 --> 00:04:49.650
- It's just a dream,

00:04:49.650 --> 00:04:50.854
you're dreaming.

00:04:50.854 --> 00:04:51.687
(rats squealing)

00:04:51.687 --> 00:04:52.520
- We're not kids anymore.

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:53.353
I mean what did you think,

00:04:53.353 --> 00:04:55.170
we're just going to sit
in our basement all day?

00:04:55.170 --> 00:04:58.520
- It's important to me that you feel safe,

00:04:58.520 --> 00:05:00.180
like this can still be your home

00:05:01.913 --> 00:05:04.154
- Can you describe its form?

00:05:04.154 --> 00:05:05.870
(distant screaming)

00:05:05.870 --> 00:05:06.703
- No

00:05:08.191 --> 00:05:11.265
extend its drawing , I think
my boundaries getting bigger,

00:05:11.265 --> 00:05:12.259
its expanding .

00:05:12.259 --> 00:05:13.145
- Anything interesting in there?

00:05:13.145 --> 00:05:14.341
- No

00:05:14.341 --> 00:05:15.883
- Ryan !

00:05:15.883 --> 00:05:18.682
(Gun shots)

00:05:18.682 --> 00:05:19.515
Shivers!

00:05:24.328 --> 00:05:25.161
- Oh my God ..

00:05:25.161 --> 00:05:25.994
- What are you looking at?

00:05:25.994 --> 00:05:26.827
What do you see?

00:05:26.827 --> 00:05:27.660
(Tires screeching )

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:28.493
What is wrong with you?

00:05:28.493 --> 00:05:29.347
Please stop it!

00:05:29.347 --> 00:05:32.338
(white noise)

00:05:32.338 --> 00:05:35.036
Were going on the trip now
, its going to be ruff.

00:05:35.036 --> 00:05:37.683
Hold on!

00:05:38.550 --> 00:05:41.960
But under no circumstance
are you allowed to take

00:05:41.960 --> 00:05:43.233
off your blindfold.

00:05:44.285 --> 00:05:45.567
- Do you hear that?

00:05:45.567 --> 00:05:47.217
- Please don't take my children !

00:05:49.253 --> 00:05:50.990
- Somethings not right about this ,

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:52.990
I think we should head back to the road.

00:05:53.981 --> 00:05:56.814
(audio distorted)

00:05:58.381 --> 00:06:00.714
(screaming)

00:06:02.634 --> 00:06:06.077
- What do you mean its happening again?

00:06:06.077 --> 00:06:08.061
- You guys gotta see this ,

00:06:08.061 --> 00:06:08.894
or her.

00:06:12.460 --> 00:06:13.513
She's coming back .

00:06:18.460 --> 00:06:21.680
- If you kill me now ,
the world as you know it

00:06:21.680 --> 00:06:22.513
will end .

00:06:23.361 --> 00:06:25.478
(car collision )

00:06:25.478 --> 00:06:29.061
(up beat heavy rock music)

